#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:1
msgid "接入 PX4"
msgstr "Integrate PX4"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **D20** 接入 PX4，并通过 QGroundControl 验证定位输出。常规使用无人机版固"
"件，通过 GPS 串口默认输出 **10 Hz UBX** 定位数据。"
msgstr ""
"Connect the **D20** to PX4 and verify positioning in QGroundControl. The "
"standard UAV firmware outputs **10 Hz UBX** over the GPS serial port."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:9
msgid ""
"根据现场条件选择 4G 或 LoRa 差分链路。固件选择见[固件与输出协议选择](../"
"operation/firmware-output.md)，完整 Pin 定义见[D20 接口与接线](../operation/"
"d20-wiring.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Choose a 4G or LoRa correction link for the site. See [Selecting Firmware "
"and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-output.md) and [D20 Interfaces "
"and Wiring](../operation/d20-wiring.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:11
msgid "硬件连接"
msgstr "Hardware connection"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:14
msgid ""
"先核对 D20 8-pin 线束，再连接飞控电源 保持设备和飞控断电，并按[完整 8-pin 定"
"义](../operation/d20-wiring.md)逐线核对。D20 供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，UART/PPS I/O "
"为 3.3 V；反接电源或把 5 V 接入信号线可能损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"Check the D20 8-pin harness before connecting flight-controller power. Keep "
"both devices powered off and verify every wire against the [complete 8-pin "
"pinout](../operation/d20-wiring.md). Supply 5 V ±0.5 V; UART/PPS I/O is 3.3 "
"V. Reversed supply polarity or 5 V on a signal pin may damage the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:17
msgid "D20 安装在机体顶部开阔位置。"
msgstr "D20 is installed in an open area on the top of the body."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:18
msgid "D20 TX 接 PX4 GPS 接口 RX。"
msgstr "D20 TX connects to PX4 GPS interface RX."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:19
msgid "D20 RX 接 PX4 GPS 接口 TX。"
msgstr "D20 RX connects to PX4 GPS interface TX."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:20
msgid "D20 GND 接 PX4 GND。"
msgstr "Connect D20 GND to PX4 GND."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:22
msgid ""
"若飞控提供明确 Pin 定义的标准 6-pin GPS/UART 接口，可以使用配套的 D20 8-pin "
"转飞控 6-pin 转接线。连接前必须同时核对转接线两端 Pin 顺序、D20 8-pin 定义和"
"飞控接口定义；接口外形匹配不代表线序一定匹配。"
msgstr ""
"If the flight controller has a clearly defined standard 6-pin GPS/UART port, "
"use the supplied D20 8-pin-to-6-pin adapter cable. Before connecting, verify "
"the pin order at both ends, the D20 8-pin pinout, and the flight-controller "
"port definition. Matching connector shapes do not guarantee matching pin "
"assignments."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:24
msgid "参数配置"
msgstr "Parameter Configuration"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:26
msgid ""
"以下参数用于说明常见 PX4 配置项。不同 PX4 版本和飞控硬件可能采用不同参数名称"
"或端口编号，应以实际固件和 QGroundControl 显示为准。"
msgstr ""
"The following parameters are used to illustrate common PX4 configuration "
"options. Different PX4 versions and flight control hardware may use "
"different parameter names or port numbers, and the actual firmware and "
"QGroundControl display should prevail."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "参数名"
msgstr "Parameter Name"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "作用"
msgstr "Function"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "建议值"
msgstr "Recommended value"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`GPS_1_CONFIG`"
msgstr "`GPS_1_CONFIG`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "选择实际连接 D20 的串口"
msgstr "Select the serial port that is actually connected to D20"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "按实际端口选择"
msgstr "Select the connected port"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`SER_GPS1_BAUD`"
msgstr "`SER_GPS1_BAUD`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置串口波特率"
msgstr "Set the serial port baud rate"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`115200`"
msgstr "`115200`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`GPS_1_PROTOCOL`"
msgstr "`GPS_1_PROTOCOL`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置 GPS 协议"
msgstr "Set GPS protocol"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`1`（UBX）"
msgstr "`1` (UBX)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`EKF2_GPS_CTRL`"
msgstr "`EKF2_GPS_CTRL`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置 GPS 融合方式"
msgstr "Set GPS fusion method"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`7`"
msgstr "`7`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "`EKF2_GPS_POS_X/Y/Z`"
msgstr "`EKF2_GPS_POS_X/Y/Z`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "设置天线相对机体的安装偏移"
msgstr "Set the installation offset of the antenna relative to the body"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:13
msgid "实测值"
msgstr "Measured value"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:36
msgid "验证"
msgstr "Verify"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:38
msgid "在 QGroundControl 中观察 GPS 状态："
msgstr "Observe GPS status in QGroundControl:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:40
msgid "PX4 持续识别 GPS，卫星数和定位数据正常更新。"
msgstr ""
"PX4 continuously recognizes the GPS and updates satellite and positioning "
"data."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:41
msgid "HDOP/VDOP 无异常。"
msgstr "HDOP/VDOP normal."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:42
msgid "开阔环境进入 RTK 固定解。"
msgstr "The receiver reaches an RTK fixed solution with an open sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:44
msgid "接入完成判据"
msgstr "Integration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:47
msgid "PX4 持续识别 GPS，并在开阔环境进入 **RTK 固定解**。"
msgstr ""
"PX4 continuously recognizes the GPS and reaches an **RTK fixed solution** "
"with an open sky view."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:50
msgid ""
"若 PX4 无法识别 D20，请先确认 D20 当前为无人机版固件，再检查飞控串口参数、"
"UART 电平兼容性和 TX/RX 接线，并在 QGroundControl 中观察 GPS 状态。"
msgstr ""
"If PX4 cannot recognize D20, first confirm that D20 is currently running the "
"UAV firmware, then check the flight controller's serial port parameters, "
"UART level compatibility, and TX/RX connections, and observe the GPS status "
"in QGroundControl."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/px4.md:52
msgid ""
"有定位输出但无法进入固定解时，按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-"
"fixed-validation.md)检查差分配置和现场条件。"
msgstr ""
"If there is position output but you cannot obtain a fixed solution, check "
"the correction setup and field conditions according to [RTK Status and Fixed "
"Solution Validation](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)."

